# 批量校准工具（scripts/calibrate/）本身是可复用的，进版本库；
# 但每次批次产出的人工判定结果、机器初判、编译计划都是那一批的工作产物，
# 落盘后即失效，不进版本库——否则下次复用时会和上一批的真实状态打架。
scripts/calibrate/decisions.json
scripts/calibrate/decisions-backups/
scripts/calibrate/suggestions.json
scripts/calibrate/judgments.json
scripts/calibrate/resolved-suggestions.json
scripts/calibrate/note-mapping.json
scripts/calibrate/plan.json
scripts/calibrate/pishuang-suspects.json
scripts/calibrate/resolve-round2.py

# 全量清点工具（scripts/audit/）同样是可复用的，进版本库；
# 但每一轮清点产出的人工判定是一次性工作产物，不进。
scripts/audit/reviews.json
scripts/audit/reviews-backups/
scripts/audit/tag-proposals.json
scripts/audit/need-games.json
scripts/audit/PENDING-REVIEW.md

# 画廊改版的本地预览素材与其清单：图片本身不进公仓，清单里又全是指向这些图片的路径，
# 进了仓库只会让别人 clone 出一页坏图。正式素材走 data/assets + public/gallery。
public/_preview/
data/_demo/gallery-preview.json
